: "Screen4.png", "id": "686700530818077", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_686700534151410_8957197507642442114_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K1oWsfk_CgkQ7kNvwEpmCQL&_nc_oc=AdngQCnYb00RJkP_WjHWy44pF7KYatrAs_g1VzG7wSMpO3RCt3cwp95BwoqcSFIPSP0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuxcVU2aoM0nei1iagLU1OPSHcnZ7LSxxbgTpEGcNfT8A&oe=699B0EF6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "OpenGateCover.png", "id": "1083210333713788", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1083210337047121_9212582815442388818_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=30JSCn7EaoQQ7kNvwFP95Hn&_nc_oc=Adnm57jKLY-hlfb9FgVvOFOiOtXSdfSNbLZpf54T6lw8lpOnOSojm2fEag9s9CWfFfM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsrqVVffEHQBumQUBdwCNQ8QX_O4o1IHLP8ufjc_JZeww&oe=699B0B9B"}, "display_name": "OpenGate XR", "keywords": ["builder", "mixed", "opengate", "creator", "editor"], "long_description": "Metagate's OpenGate XR is a webapp that lets you create your own Mixed Reality environment from your smartphone or PC completely independently!\n \n- Register on the webapp (app.themetagate.it) via email or Google.\n- Log in with the same credentials on the OpenGate app on the viewer.\n- Upload images, videos or 3D models that you can interact with in MR (move, scale and save position).\n- Create a 3D travelling companion with customisable artificial intelligence (GPT based) that you can talk to in MR.\n\nSupported formats:\n- Images: png, jpg;\n- Video: mp4;\n- 3D models: glb, fbx.", "short_description": "Create your own experience with the first Mixed Reality builder.\nUpload your assets: images, videos and 3D models. Even add your own AI Avatar. All without code!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://discover.themetagate.it/pages/policy-privacy-opengate-xr", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity", "support_website_